{"_id":"0cdd50aaa65e4360","name":"Voices","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":"You have learned to challenge your Midi-chlorians. If you succeed, you force them to obey your commands for a change. If you fail, your Use the Force modifier suffers. Once per encounter, as a swift action, roll 1d20 + your Character Level against your own Force Defense. Apply the result as a modifier to your Use the Force checks. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge Control! Control! You're finally learning Control! As a Free Action, you may add +5 to your Force Defense or your own rolls versus your own Force Defense during the encounter. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control You're learning to follow your own path. You may reroll any Midi-chlorian check and may take the better result. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control Now YOU are the Master. If you receive a Midi-chlorian request, you may ignore it and still receive the temporary Force Point.","benefit":"You have learned to challenge your Midi-chlorians. If you succeed, you force them to obey your commands for a change. If you fail, your Use the Force modifier suffers. Once per encounter, as a swift action, roll 1d20 + your Character Level against your own Force Defense. Apply the result as a modifier to your Use the Force checks. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge Control! Control! You're finally learning Control! As a Free Action, you may add +5 to your Force Defense or your own rolls versus your own Force Defense during the encounter. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control You're learning to follow your own path. You may reroll any Midi-chlorian check and may take the better result. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control Now YOU are the Master. If you receive a Midi-chlorian request, you may ignore it and still receive the temporary Force Point.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"e85cb1a787e24cac","tags":["action_economy","defender","force","force_control","force_defense","force_execution","force_point_spend","mind_affecting","mobility","resource_spend","social","striker","support","swift_action","uncategorized_talent","use_the_force","phase-t28-reviewed"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_force_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"voices","name":"Voices","label":"Voices","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You have learned to challenge your Midi-chlorians. If you succeed, you force them to obey your commands for a change. If you fail, your Use the Force modifier suffers. Once per encounter, as a swift action, roll 1d20 + your Character Level against your own Force Defense. Apply the result as a modifier to your Use the Force checks. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge Control! Control! You're finally learning Control! As a Free Action, you may add +5 to your Force Defense or your own rolls versus your own Force Defense during the encounter. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control You're learning to follow your own path. You may reroll any Midi-chlorian check and may take the better result. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control Now YOU are the Master. If you receive a Midi-chlorian request, you may ignore it and still receive the temporary Force Point.","notes":"You have learned to challenge your Midi-chlorians. If you succeed, you force them to obey your commands for a change. If you fail, your Use the Force modifier suffers. Once per encounter, as a swift action, roll 1d20 + your Character Level against your own Force Defense. Apply the result as a modifier to your Use the Force checks. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge Control! Control! You're finally learning Control! As a Free Action, you may add +5 to your Force Defense or your own rolls versus your own Force Defense during the encounter. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control You're learning to follow your own path. You may reroll any Midi-chlorian check and may take the better result. Prerequisites: , Midi-chlorian Challenge, Midi-chlorian Control Now YOU are the Master. If you receive a Midi-chlorian request, you may ignore it and still receive the temporary Force Point.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["Force Point context","Once per encounter"],"requiredContext":["Ally context confirmed"],"targetHint":"GM/player adjudicated target or affected creature(s)","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"notes":"T28 removed unsafe migrated modifier/effect data. This talent depends on Force-suite, target, equipment, ally, encounter, or table-position context and is surfaced as a truthful manual/runtime card rather than a passive actor mutation.","phase28ForceMicrotraditionCleanup":{"phase":"T28","tree":"Midichlorian","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Force/special-tradition microtree cleanup. Unsafe always-on rows were removed; final bonuses/effects require player/GM or future dedicated runtime owner."}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.403Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"0de7338c2b984b96","name":"Droid Receptacle","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":", Shedding of the Body When catching a Second Wind, you may add your Hit Points to the when calculating the amount healed (one-quarter of the total). Likewise, when you are healed by Vital Transfer, Bolster Ally, or similar abilities, you may add the Droid's Character Levels to your own to determine the amount healed. Prerequisite: , Shedding of the Body When you take damage, as a Reaction you may transfer any amount of damage done to the to your Hit Points instead. You can also transfer any number of levels on the Condition Track to yourself as part of the Reaction. You may use this ability to lower the amount of damage below the Droid's Damage Threshold, for example. However, if the damage you absorb is above your own Damage Threshold, you move -1 on the Condition Track as usual. B'omarr brain jars may be carried by a small (typically a modified Arakyd BT-16 Security Droid). While the character's brain jar is carried, they are treated as piloting the as a Vehicle with Total Cover. (Pilot skill checks and related Talents and Feats such as Vehicular Combat apply and may even perform Starship Maneuvers.) Additionally this \"Blindsight\" allows you to ignore Concealment (including Total Concealment) from darkness. However, you cannot perceive colors in total darkness.","benefit":", Shedding of the Body When catching a Second Wind, you may add your Hit Points to the when calculating the amount healed (one-quarter of the total). Likewise, when you are healed by Vital Transfer, Bolster Ally, or similar abilities, you may add the Droid's Character Levels to your own to determine the amount healed. Prerequisite: , Shedding of the Body When you take damage, as a Reaction you may transfer any amount of damage done to the to your Hit Points instead. You can also transfer any number of levels on the Condition Track to yourself as part o