{"_id":"125b5aa00f5a4d0a","name":"Morgukai Resolve","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Cortosis Staff), Nikto Survival (Kajain'sa'Nikto)","description":"Dexterity 13, Proficient in Armor Worn Morgukai warriors craft their armor from rare cortosis ore that has the unusual ability to repel Lightsaber strikes, and they train to maximize the effectiveness of this trait. You add your armor's Fortitude Defense bonus as an Equipment bonus to your Elite Trooper Damage Reduction (With a maximum bonus equal to your base Elite Trooper DR), a Lightsaber does not ignore your Damage Reduction. Additionally, you add your armor's Fortitude Defense bonus as an Equipment bonus to the reaction roll initiated by a successful Lightsaber attack to deactivate the Lightsaber.","benefit":"Dexterity 13, Proficient in Armor Worn Morgukai warriors craft their armor from rare cortosis ore that has the unusual ability to repel Lightsaber strikes, and they train to maximize the effectiveness of this trait. You add your armor's Fortitude Defense bonus as an Equipment bonus to your Elite Trooper Damage Reduction (With a maximum bonus equal to your base Elite Trooper DR), a Lightsaber does not ignore your Damage Reduction. Additionally, you add your armor's Fortitude Defense bonus as an Equipment bonus to the reaction roll initiated by a successful Lightsaber attack to deactivate the Lightsaber.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"0a61ab9ece844326","tags":["action_economy","anti_lightsaber","armor","cortosis","damage_reduction","defender","duelist","feat_chain","lightsaber","melee","melee_defense","offense_melee","reaction","striker","support","talent_chain","tree_0a61ab9ece844326","uncategorized_talent","phase-t28-reviewed"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"reaction_or_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution"