{"_id":"61c9413bde23411a","name":"Extended Sputters","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":"- You’ve learned a few throttle tricks that can extend the duration of your jet pack’s Sputtering state from one turn to two consecutive turns. However, if you use these tricks, you can’t use any move actions to gain altitude during this sputter.","benefit":"- You’ve learned a few throttle tricks that can extend the duration of your jet pack’s Sputtering state from one turn to two consecutive turns. However, if you use these tricks, you can’t use any move actions to gain altitude during this sputter.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"25d99948c9cb41ad","tags":["action_economy","controller","mobility","pilot","survivability","tree_25d99948c9cb41ad","uncategorized_talent","vehicle"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"passive_reference","applicationScope":"jetpack_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Jumptrooper","status":"cleaned_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Unsafe passive/ActiveEffect data removed. Talent is represented by action cards, attack options, hit/critical riders, or explicit manual metadata as appropriate."},"combatActions":[{"id":"extended-sputters","name":"Extended Sputters","label":"Extended Sputters","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You may extend a jet-pack Sputtering state to two consecutive turns, but you cannot use move actions to gain altitude during that sputter.","notes":"You may extend a jet-pack Sputtering state to two consecutive turns, but you cannot use move actions to gain altitude during that sputter.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Jet pack spu