{"_id":"62e70280d08f43ec","name":"Allure","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":"As a Full-Round Action, you can beguile one or more targets of your choice within 6 squares and line of sight, making a Persuasion check against their Will Defense. If successful, the targets suffer a -5 penalty to Perception checks for one round. You can keep the targets captivated as a Full-Round Action each subsequent round, making a new Persuasion check each time. The effect immediately ends if the targets are attacked or threatened. Homebrew Reference Book: New Republic Campaign Guide When making an opposed Deception or Persuasion check, you receive a +2 circumstance bonus to the check. Additionally, in the case of a tie in the opposed check, your result is victorious. If your opponent also has this Talent, normal resolution rules apply. Homebrew Reference Book: New Republic Campaign Guide You receive a +2 competence bonus to all Deception and Persuasion checks. Additionally, you are also considered Trained in those skill if not already.","benefit":"As a Full-Round Action, you can beguile one or more targets of your choice within 6 squares and line of sight, making a Persuasion check against their Will Defense. If successful, the targets suffer a -5 penalty to Perception checks for one round. You can keep the targets captivated as a Full-Round Action each subsequent round, making a new Persuasion check each time. The effect immediately ends if the targets are attacked or threatened. Homebrew Reference Book: New Republic Campaign Guide When making an opposed Deception or Persuasion check, you receive a +2 circumstance bonus to the check. Additionally, in the case of a tie in the opposed check, your result is victorious. If your opponent also has this Talent, normal resolution rules apply. Homebrew Reference Book: New Republic Campaign Guide You receive a +2 competence bonus to all Deception and Persuasion checks. Additionally, you are also considered Trained in those skill if not already.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"8375b9b26b679901","tags":["action_economy","charm","deception","defender","mind_affecting","perception","persuasion","positioning","skills","social","social_control","striker","support","sustained_damage","tree_8375b9b26b679901","uncategorized_talent"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Follower/dependent-actor subsystem or GM/player managed","notes":"Ally/follower/minion effects need dependent actor, adjacency, line-of-sight, attack, or action timing context; they should not mutate owner static totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"allure","name":"Allure","label":"Allure","actionType":"full-round","cost":1,"manualResolution":false,"resolutionMode":"auto","useLabel":"Roll / Use","description":"Beguile one or more targets within 6 squares and line of sight; roll Persuasion against Will Defense. On success, affected targets take -5 to Perception for 1 round. Maintaining the effect requires another Full-Round Action and check.","notes":"Beguile one or more targets within 6 squares and line of sight; roll Persuasion against Will Defense. On success, affected targets take -5 to Perception for 1 round. Maintaining the effect requires another Full-Round Action and check.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"persuasion","when":""}],"resources":["Mind-affecting social effect","Ends if targets are attacked or threatened"],"requiredContext":["Targets can see/hear/understand you as appropriate"],"targetHint":"Targets within 6 squares and line of sight","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{},"skillKey":"persuasion"}],"manualResolution":false,"phase23SocialCommanderCleanup":{"phase":"T23","tree":"Influence","status":"combat_action_card","cardsAdded":1,"notes